          "media": {
            "duration": 9000,
            "fileSize": 74140350
          },
          "description": "Create a relaxing environment for your child's bedtime routine with this calming audio collection.  \n\nDeveloped with The Children's Sleep Charity, and parent-tested, Ladybird Sleepy Tales are specially designed to help 3- to 6-year-olds wind down after a day's activity.  \n\nFollow a snowflake as it gently travels to the ground, float around in a bouncy bubble or take a magical journey to the end of a rainbow. Each gentle tale is rich with soothing sound effects. So dim the lights, snuggle up and get ready for a good night's rest.   \n\nIncludes 10 relaxing tales: 'Blowing Bubbles', 'Colour Fairies', 'Sky Magic', 'Inside the Cosy Cocoon', 'Special Rabbit', 'Sleepy Sandcastles', 'The Drifting Snowflake', 'Sunflower Snuggles', 'A Bedtime Picture' and 'The Sleepy King'.",
          "author": "Ladybird",
